# ONNX Models

These models are downloaded automatically during `pnpm install` via the postinstall script.

Models:
- basic-pitch-nmp.onnx (~225 KB) — Spotify's polyphonic MIDI transcription
- htdemucs.onnx (~303 MB) — Meta's HTDemucs v4 stem separation

To manually download: pnpm run download-models

Models are .gitignored (too large for git).
